@startuml Friends_Flow

skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 2
skinparam roundcorner 10
skinparam maxmessagesize 60

title Manage Friends Flow

actor User
participant "GoalsScreen" as Goals
participant "AchieviaNavGraph" as Nav
participant "FriendsScreen" as Friends
participant "GoalRepository" as Repo

User -> Goals: Open navigation drawer
User -> Goals: Click "Friends" menu item
Goals -> Nav: onNavigateToFriends()
activate Nav
Nav -> Friends: Navigate to FriendsScreen
activate Friends
Friends --> User: Display friends list

User -> Friends: Click "Add Friend" button
Friends -> Friends: Show AddFriendDialog
User -> Friends: Enter friend name and email
User -> Friends: Click "Add Friend"
Friends -> Friends: Add friend to local list
Friends --> User: Display new friend in list

User -> Friends: Click delete icon on friend
Friends -> Friends: Remove friend from list
Friends --> User: Update friends list

User -> Friends: Click back button
Friends -> Nav: onNavigateBack()
deactivate Friends
Nav -> Goals: Return to GoalsScreen
deactivate Nav

note right of Friends
  Currently uses in-memory
  state. Future: Integrate
  with backend API for
  persistent friend management
end note

@enduml

